{
  "description": "SECOND, HARDER retrieval set (v2) over the same 'Shardfall' corpus in eval/corpus. Written AFTER the M14 reranker decision and after seeing the v1 results, by the AI assistant, not an independent party, so it targets the weaknesses v1 revealed (multi-hop, negation, derived numbers, low word overlap, code reasoning). It has not been used to tune anything. Questions with `require_all` are credited only at the rank by which every expected source has been retrieved.",
  "kinds": {
    "multi_hop": "needs facts from more than one chunk (often a computation)",
    "negation": "the answer is 'no' or turns on 'not'",
    "paraphrase_hard": "shares almost no words with the source",
    "code_reasoning": "the behaviour must be read off the code",
    "identifier": "names a config key that also has a design-doc description"
  },
